/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# quarto's book renderer writes a loose index.html next to each chapter's
# index.qmd, in addition to the real output-dir (_site/) -- every one of
# these is generated, never hand-authored (verified 9 Sep: zero were
# tracked in git before this rule). Bit twice by this locally; guard it.
**/index.html

# Rendered book output. output-dir in _quarto.yml; publish-guide.yml renders
# it fresh in CI and uploads it as a Pages artifact, so it never needs to be
# tracked. Same class of cruft as the index.html rule above.
/_site/

# Quarto's shared JS/CSS bundle. Written next to the project (not only into
# output-dir) by `quarto preview` and by a plain render, entirely generated,
# and regenerated on every build. Same class as _site/ and index.html above.
/site_libs/
